Aim

To configure Amazon S3 bucket event notifications that trigger Amazon SNS and send email alerts whenever an object is uploaded to the bucket.

Procedure
Step 1: Create S3 Bucket
Open:
Amazon S3
Click:
Create Bucket
Configure:
Field	Value
Bucket Name	my-upload-bucket-2026
Region	Same region as SNS
Click:
Create Bucket
Step 2: Create SNS Topic
Open Amazon SNS.

Create Topic:

S3UploadNotification
Add Email Subscription.
Confirm email subscription.
Step 3: Configure SNS Access Policy
Open SNS Topic.
Go to:
Access Policy → Edit
Allow S3 service to publish notifications to SNS topic.
Save policy.
Step 4: Configure S3 Event Notification
Open S3 Bucket.
Go to:
Properties
Scroll to:
Event Notifications
Click:
Create Event Notification
Configure Event
Field	Value
Event Name	UploadNotification
Event Type	All Object Create Events
Destination	SNS Topic

Select SNS topic:

S3UploadNotification
Save changes.
Step 5: Test the Setup
Upload any file into S3 bucket.
Verify:
S3 triggers SNS notification
Email notification received
Observation
S3 bucket created successfully.
SNS notifications configured correctly.
Uploading object triggered email notification automatically.
Result

Successfully configured S3 event notifications using SNS to send email alerts when files are uploaded to an S3 bucket.
